{"id":"h6-12-p12","title":"Design Top-K trending","scopeHtml":"<p>Scope: requirements, API, sliding windows, Count-Min Sketch, heavy hitters, stream aggregation. Questions are still to be written.</p>","notes":[{"id":"requirements","title":"Requirements","html":"<p><strong>Top-K trending finds the K most popular items (hashtags, searches, videos, products) in a recent time window, for example \"top 10 hashtags in the last hour\".</strong> Twitter/X trends, YouTube trending, Google Trends, and \"trending searches\" in an e-commerce app are examples. The difficulty is counting a firehose of events without storing or sorting all of them.</p>\n<p><strong>Functional requirements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ingest a stream of events (a hashtag was used, a video was viewed).</li>\n<li>Return the top K items for a window: last 1 minute, 1 hour, 24 hours.</li>\n<li>Optionally per region or per category.</li>\n<li>Trending means a surge, not just the biggest all-time count.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Non-functional requirements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Freshness: results within 1-5 s for the minute window, within a minute for longer windows.</li>\n<li>Query latency under 20 ms (served from a precomputed result).</li>\n<li>Scale: 1M events/s peak, 100M distinct items.</li>\n<li>Approximate answers are acceptable (the 10th item being off by 0.5% does not matter); the system must never fall over.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"flow\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1039.6 68\" width=\"1039.6\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"High-level shape\"><defs><marker id=\"fa\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M129.60000000000002 34 L185.60000000000002 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M129.60000000000002 34 L185.60000000000002 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.167;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.167;0.168;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M317.6 34 L373.6 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M317.6 34 L373.6 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.167;0.333;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.167;0.333;0.334;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M556 34 L612 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M556 34 L612 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.333;0.500;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.333;0.500;0.501;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M715.2 34 L771.2 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M715.2 34 L771.2 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.500;0.667;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.500;0.667;0.668;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M881.6 34 L937.6 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M881.6 34 L937.6 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.667;0.833;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.667;0.833;0.834;1\"/></circle><rect x=\"12\" y=\"12\" width=\"117.60000000000001\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"70.80000000000001\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Event sources</text><rect x=\"185.60000000000002\" y=\"12\" width=\"132\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"251.60000000000002\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Ingestion queue</text><rect x=\"373.6\" y=\"12\" width=\"182.4\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"464.8\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Counting / aggregation</text><rect x=\"612\" y=\"12\" width=\"103.2\" height=\"44\" rx=\"22\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"663.6\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Top-K store</text><rect x=\"771.2\" y=\"12\" width=\"110.4\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"826.4000000000001\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Trending API</text><rect x=\"937.6\" y=\"12\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"982.6\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Users</text></svg><figcaption>High-level shape</figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong>Decision gravity.</strong> Choose approximate counting (Count-Min Sketch plus a heap, or sampling) over exact counts in a database, because exact per-item counters for 100M items across 1M events/s are expensive and unnecessary. Reversible: you can later run an exact batch job in parallel to correct the approximation (the Lambda-style pattern).</p>\n<p><strong>Everyday analogy.</strong> A radio station's weekly chart: they do not track every listener; a sample is enough to rank the songs.</p>\n<p><strong>Common interview traps.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Using <code>SELECT item, COUNT(*) GROUP BY item ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10</code> on raw events.</li>\n<li>Forgetting the time window (counts of \"all time\" are not trending).</li>\n<li>Treating trending as just \"most frequent\", ignoring burst/velocity.</li>\n</ul>"},{"id":"api","title":"API","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">GET /v</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/trending?scope=global&#x26;window=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">h&#x26;k=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1h\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#00